What does this code usually mean?

```javascript
useEffect(() => {
  loadPosts();
}, []);
```

What does this code do?

```javascript
const [posts, setPosts] = useState([]);

useEffect(() => {
  async function loadPosts() {
    const response = await fetch('/api/posts');
    const data = await response.json();
    setPosts(data);
  }

  loadPosts();
}, []);
```

